{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108307","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108307","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1710830701:1":{"text":"屏障生效了！迪兹，你也太厉害了！","source_cn":"屏障生效了！迪兹，你也太厉害了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84809FC4F66E945D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710830702:1":{"text":"别高兴得太早。屏障只能防御，不能攻击魔物。","source_cn":"别高兴得太早。屏障只能防御，不能攻击魔物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD14412B64B5E6C4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710830703:1":{"text":"必须想办法主动出击，减轻守备军的压力。","source_cn":"必须想办法主动出击，减轻守备军的压力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39CF68A1133A2009","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710830704:1":{"text":"啊？主动出击？我们两个吗？","source_cn":"啊？主动出击？我们两个吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F91FFC75CD6183C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710830705:1":{"text":"……格温妮丝队长，关于这点我还有一个提议。","source_cn":"……格温妮丝队长，关于这点我还有一个提议。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3ECA784E0694B52B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710830706:1":{"text":"迪兹